description_text:
Modular Lake Village stalls is a collection of  39 3D models that allows you to build marketplaces. It includes tents, meat, fish, boxes, logs etc
Features:
4K textures;LOD levels;customized colliders;

Motel

  - 15 PBR Materials;

  - doors and interiors are separated;

  - low poly models;

  - clear geometry;

  - UE4 collision included;

Polycount:

  - Decoration - 738 polygons;

  - Lobby_Exterior - 2,827 polygons;

  - Lobby_Interior - 205 polygons:

  - Rooms_Exterior - 21,279 poygons;

  - Rooms_Interior - 2,730 polygons;

  - Door_Average - 840 polygons;

  - Door_Entrance - 978 polygons;

Ruined Church

  - 4 PBR Materials;

  - Interior separated;

  - low poly models;

  - clear geometry;

  - UE4 collision included;

Polycount:

  - Church_Ext - 46, 404 polygons;

  - Church_Int - 13, 861 polygons;

Matertials: Albedo, Normal Map, AO, Roughness.

Rendered images in Substance Painter and Marmoset Toolbag 4 with 4k textures.

Textures resolution is from 1024x1024 to 4096x4096, 8 bits + dithering.

Models have such texture packs:

  - Textures PBR metallic roughnes;

  - Textures for UnrealEngine4;

  - Textures for Unity5.

3D Models consists of:

1) Wooden Wagon  ( 2 normal maps ):

  - verts: 5378;

  - faces: 4771;

  - tris: 9426.

2) Wooden Small Cart ( 1 normal map ):

  - verts: 1692;

  - faces: 1494;

  - tris: 2956.

3) Wooden Wheelbarrow ( 1 normal map ):

  - verts: 1726;

  - faces: 1478;

  - tris: 2928.

Including BLEND, USD, FBX and OBJ formats.

Created in Blender v.2.93.5.

7 Sci-Fi Builidings assets pack
This Sci-Fi buildings assets pack is great for set-dressing your future cinematics scene or could be used in your video game project. All the models are unwrapped and textured with some basic tileable PBR materials such as concrete, glass, metal and bitumen roof. 
The assets pack includes:
Models

  - Mega building 01;

  - Mega building 02;

  - Medium building 01;

  - Medium building 02;

  - Medium building 03;

  - Small building 01;

  - Small building 02;

All the models are exported in fbx. file formal, unwrapped and ready to be used.
Textures:

  - Grainy concrete;

  - Bitumen roof;

  - Brushed aluminum;

  - Chromatic windows;

All these textures are exported in png. file format, PBR ready and are 2048x2048 size.
Work Files

  -  Blender scene with all the buildings and assigned correct materials;

  - Marmoset Toolbag 3 render scene with set-up lighting and ready for making some cool renders;

If you have any questions feel free to contact me and I'll happy to help you.
Cheers!
